  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Oxidation :&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mi>COO</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mi>COO</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>Reduction :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"\"><mrow><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Ag</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi>Ag</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>CHO</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Ag</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#10230;</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>Molecular mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfenced></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>CHO</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>44</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Equivalent weight <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>E&#969;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>factor</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>44</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Since aldehyde is getting oxidised therefore, it is acting as reducing agent and not oxidising agent.</p>",
